    owl:allValuesFrom <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation>.
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/Stimulus> rdfs:subClassOf 054.
_:n3-2056 a owl:Restriction.
_:n3-2057 owl:inverseOf <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/detects>.
n3-2056 owl:onProperty n3-2057;
    owl:allValuesFrom <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sensor>.
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/Stimulus> rdfs:subClassOf 056.
